<title>USA: American Electric unit to redeem bonds.</title>
<headline>American Electric unit to redeem bonds.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indiana Michigan Power Co, a subsidiary of American Electric Power Co, said Tuesday it will redeem the entire outstanding $50 million principal amount of its 8.75 percent first mortgage bonds due 2022 on May 29, 1997.</p>
<p>It will redeem them at 100 percent of the principal plus interest accrued from May 1, 1997 to May 29, 1997.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
